If you really, really want Grayswandir, then dip for Excalibur and
avoid sacrificing to reduce the number of artifacts generated. Then
use a wish at the castle. Excalibur is better than Grayswandir at +0
and still competitive at +7 against non-demons. Frost Brand is a great
choice but is notably weak on the Astral plane.
