Get teleport control and *keep your stash in the main dungeon*, if
you're a Valk. That way you can use the Orb to level-teleport to/from
your stash.
And if you need to move, just take the scrolls, potions, and spare
magical armor, the most important (and lightest!) pieces of your
stash.

If you try a wizard next, then keep a Sokoban stash, which will be
easily accessible via the Eye.


